.Dd June 9, 2026
.Dt MBT_LSD 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mbt_lsd_new ,
.Nm mbt_lsd_free ,
.Nm mbt_lsd_announce ,
.Nd LSD listener + announcer (BEP 14 multicast discovery)
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In mbt/lsd.h
.Ft int
.Fn mbt_lsd_new "struct mbt_lsd **out" "struct mbt_ev *ev"
.Ft void
.Fn mbt_lsd_free "struct mbt_lsd *h"
.Ft int
.Fn mbt_lsd_announce "struct mbt_lsd *lsd" "const struct mbt_infohash *ih"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Local Service Discovery via UDP multicast on 239.192.152.143:6771.

.Pp
Fn mbt_lsd_new
creates the interface.  Announce sends advertisements for local discovery.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Fn mbt_lsd_new
returns 0 success otherwise negative errno opening the socket failed.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mbt_session 3 ,
.Xr mbt_dht 3
